{"id":"vod_hh_28492","vodId":"28492","provider":"hh","providerName":"豪华资源","type":2,"name":"极黑的布伦希尔特","name_cn":"极黑的布伦希尔特","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第13集","images":{"common":"https://hhmage.com/cover/76c1922dbf7e6b9d65c1c0d06e8f9118.jpg"},"summary":"学业优秀的高中二年级学生村上良太（逢坂良太 配音）是天文部唯一一名成员，童年时代他曾有过十分要好的朋友“黑猫”，但在一次事故中，少女黑猫为了营救良太而被宣告死亡。这起事件给了良太沉重的打击与创伤，因此他才希望代替黑猫仰望星空，找到传说中的外星人。这一天，美丽女孩黑羽宁子（种田梨沙 配音）转到良太的班级，他惊讶地发现，黑羽竟和黑猫长得极其相像。宁子是个奇怪神秘的女孩，她不会九九乘法，却能够预测他人的死期。她在暴雨中拯救了本该死去的良太，并向对方透露了其魔法使的身份。为了保护良太，宁子拒绝与之过多接触。然而好奇心十足且对过去抱着诸多疑问的良太，还是义无返顾闯入了一个神秘而危险的世界……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-05-30 16:59:35","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"hhm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/penmVDld/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/PdyAORWd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/1aMKm03d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/9b6x7k9e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/mepo6G6d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Ddwy8Pwa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Rb4vDg6e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/YerqNK6d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/9aAX2n1e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/nelkVA6d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/QeZGD56a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/RdGX2ZQe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Xe0oy4Xd/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:46:13.155Z"}